# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan: Triage

section First Aid 225-240

step Trauma
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Artisan First Aid comes from the Triage quest. It needs skill 225 and level 35, though the quest itself is level 45. The First Aid trainer in Ironforge sends you to the doctor in Theramore. Bring everything you need to reach 300 now: about 90 Mageweave Cloth and 70 Runecloth. You learn the next three bandages from the same doctor, and bandages need no fire, so you craft beside him.
  skill "First Aid" 225
  level 35
  accept 6625

step Trauma
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Artisan First Aid comes from the Triage quest. It needs skill 225 and level 35, though the quest itself is level 45. The First Aid trainer in Orgrimmar sends you to the doctor in Hammerfall. Bring everything you need to reach 300 now: about 90 Mageweave Cloth and 70 Runecloth. You learn the next three bandages from the same doctor, and bandages need no fire, so you craft beside him.
  skill "First Aid" 225
  level 35
  accept 6623

step Triage
  only Alliance
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Triage: the doctor hands you Triage Bandages; use those, not your own. Fifteen patients lie in the room: heal the critically injured first, then the badly injured, then the injured, before any die. Show the health bars with Ctrl+V, zoom the camera out, stand in the middle of the room, and pre-select the next patient while you heal. Turn it in the moment fifteen are saved: the others keep dying, and too many deaths fail it even after it reads complete. If another player is talking to the doctor, he sometimes will not offer the quest: wait a bit and talk to him again.
  turnin 6625
  accept 6624
  complete 6624
  turnin 6624

step Triage
  only Horde
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Triage: the doctor hands you Triage Bandages; use those, not your own. Fifteen patients lie in the room: heal the critically injured first, then the badly injured, then the injured, before any die. Show the health bars with Ctrl+V, zoom the camera out, stand in the middle of the room, and pre-select the next patient while you heal. Turn it in the moment fifteen are saved: the others keep dying, and too many deaths fail it even after it reads complete. If another player is talking to the doctor, he sometimes will not offer the quest: wait a bit and talk to him again.
  turnin 6623
  accept 6622
  complete 6622
  turnin 6622

