step Runecloth Bandage (260-290)
  tip Runecloth Bandage, 44 crafts to 290. If you would rather finish on potions you can sell or use, stop the bandages at 275 and brew 30 Major Healing Potion instead (30 Golden Sansam, 90 Soothing Spices, 30 Crystal Vial). The recipe is Manual: Major Healing Potion: check the Auction House first and buy it there if it is under 8g, else from Pexmit in Mount Hyjal for 8g. Horde can also earn it from Ortak Lomgok in Elderwild, Mount Hyjal, as the reward for A Rest Without Pain.
  craft 18629 "Runecloth Bandage" until 290

